flowchart TD
    A[StartAsyncV2] --> B[Acquire DB Lease]
    B --> C[BuildRuntimeTasks]
    C --> D[Register Running State]
    D --> E[runDynamicLoop]

    E --> F[Compile DAG Templates]
    F --> G[Create Dependency Manager]
    G --> H[Find Ready Nodes]

    H --> I[reconcileDynamicCandidates]
    I --> J[Create AnalysisNode]
    J --> K[pumpReadyQueue]

    K --> L[WorkerPool]
    L --> M[NodeDispatcher]
    M --> N[Executor]

    N --> O[RuntimeEvent]
    O --> P{Node Success?}

    P -->|Yes| Q[Unlock downstream nodes]
    P -->|No| R[Block downstream nodes]

    Q --> H
    R --> H